# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Lexa AI Frontend — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
# NEVER put secret/private keys in VITE_ variables — they will be visible
# to anyone who inspects the built JavaScript.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Supabase (PUBLIC — safe for VITE_ prefix) ────────────────────────────────
# These are your Supabase project's public URL and anon key.
# The anon key is designed to be public and is safe in the browser.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...your-anon-key

# ── Chat Backend Endpoint ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL of your Hono/Express backend that proxies LLM API calls.
# Defaults to /api/chat if not set.
# VITE_CHAT_ENDPOINT=/api/chat

# ── Social Links (PUBLIC — safe for VITE_ prefix) ────────────────────────────
# VITE_TWITTER_URL=https://twitter.com/yourhandle
# VITE_LINKEDIN_URL=
# VITE_GITHUB_URL=
# VITE_YOUTUBE_URL=

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ⚠️  NEVER ADD THESE AS VITE_ VARIABLES:
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# OPENAI_API_KEY             → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY          → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# GEMINI_API_KEY             → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# GROQ_API_KEY               → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY         → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
# TAVILY_API_KEY             → Server-side only (Edge Functions)
#
# These must ONLY be set in your Supabase Edge Function environment
# or your backend server's environment. If you prefix them with VITE_,
# they will be embedded in the browser-visible JavaScript bundle.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
